     *===============================================================*                       RADDAT
     *   >>PRE-COMPILER<<                                            *                       RADDAT
     *                                                               *                       RADDAT
     *     >>CRTCMD<<  CRTRPGMOD    MODULE(&LI/&OB) +                *                       RADDAT
     *                              SRCFILE(&SL/&SF) +               *                       RADDAT
     *                              SRCMBR(&SM);                     *                       RADDAT
     *                                                               *                       RADDAT
     *     >>COMPILE<<                                               *                       RADDAT
     *       >>PARM<< TRUNCNBR(*NO);                                 *                       RADDAT
     *       >>PARM<< DBGVIEW(*LIST);                                *                       RADDAT
     *       >>PARM<< TGTRLS(*CURRENT);                              *                       RADDAT
     *     >>END-COMPILE<<                                           *                       RADDAT
     *                                                               *                       RADDAT
     *     >>EXECUTE<<                                               *                       RADDAT
     *                                                               *                       RADDAT
     *     >>CMD<<     CRTPGM       PGM(&LI/&OB) +                   *                       RADDAT
     *                              MODULE(&LI/&OB) +                *                       RADDAT
     *                              ACTGRP(*NEW) +                   *                       RADDAT
     *                              BNDSRVPGM(&LI/IFS2     +         *                       RADDAT
     *                                        &LI/BASICS1) +         *                       RADDAT
     *                              BNDDIR(QC2LE         ) +         *                       RADDAT
     *                              TGTRLS(*CURRENT) +               *
     *                              DETAIL(*BASIC);                  *                       RADDAT
     *                                                               *                       RADDAT
     *   >>END-PRE-COMPILER<<                                        *                       RADDAT
